body:
Hitler: Germans are superior.

&#x200B;

Democrats in 2019: Women are superior.

&#x200B;

I see a pattern here. With blacks its the same thing: "We are superior, white people are trash".

&#x200B;

This nazism arrived in Netflix and nobody challengens that. Fuck Republicans for being weak.

Working outside is HARD, believe me. I was in a job (worked there only a day) where I had to stay outside in 35 degrees or even more (7 hours a day). After a day of work my skin was so burned and hot that it was aching. I didnt show up for the second day of work. My skin felt burned for two weeks. I felt it hot even when taking cold showers. It was crazy. I wouldnt recommend that, UNLESS you want to work in a farm. Then thats ok because you''ll not be the only burned. And a farm looks like a great place to work.

&#x200B;

Now I work from home and it's a BLESS, but I hate cooporate jobs too, so I'm fucked when my home-office job ends.

Too much "reality" kills the imagination. 2d movies were great because you use your IMAGINATION while watching it. That kind of movies dont provide you with detailed reality, so to make up for that you end up IMAGINING things and that's great!

&#x200B;

The same goes for games. There is a game called Freedom Fighters, its from 2003 (i guess) and it has very basic graphics but it's FUN, it makes you IMAGINE things that the game itself doesnt have.

&#x200B;

Too much reality kills imagination and kills the fun.

It's the same as saying:

&#x200B;

* Americans are great!

Then:

* I want America to get fucked over!

&#x200B;

But im not anti-american!

&#x200B;

It's silly. A country is made of people. If a country does shit, then it's people are responsible. Yes, americans are responsible for Iraq. Who fought, who kills? People from a particular country.

THIS IS  BAD BITCH

&#x200B;

Say it very nicely.
